\ The fault explainer's record: a load from where nothing is mapped (@ on  ok.
\ a wrong address) raises a BusFault, which Stellaris takes as HardFault.  ok.
\ With the fault break on (as in the app) the chip stops right there.  ok.
#!fault
no fault
#!timeout 500
#!faultbreak 1
: show-temp ( -- ) $60000000 @ . ;  ok.
: main ( -- ) 3 show-temp ;  ok.
main
